      "latex": "\\int_{-1}^2 |x^3 - x| \\, dx = \\int_{-1}^0 (x^3 - x) \\, dx + \\int_0^1 -(x^3 - x) \\, dx + \\int_1^2 (x^3 - x) \\, dx",
