      "latex": "= \\left(\\frac{0 - \\frac{1}{2}}{0}\\right) + \\left(\\frac{1}{2} - \\frac{1}{4}\\right) + \\left(\\frac{4-2}{4} - \\left(\\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{1}{2}\\right)\\right)",
